[style]
if {chatstep} == 0.0:
	Left Click The Mouse To Continue Through Dialogues.
	boss: Hello there!
	boss: My name is Georgio, I am your new boss! Your job here is simple..
	boss: You will see a ! above anyone who needs help. Make sure you guide them correctly. The more bad things you prevent the more money I... I mean we.. make.
	boss: I have noticed that some of our employees have been getting some strange emails. Go through them and make sure no one accidentally destroys the company!
	boss: Remeber our company motto\: SHAREHOLDER VALUE > I
	[signal arg="complete_chat1"]
elif {chatstep} == 1.0:
	boss: Welp thanks for that. But it looks like Henry is having some trouble too..
	boss: Seems pretty onvious to me, but give him some guidance on his email.
	lucy: Hey there... I'm Lucy.. You can call me Loo!
	lucy: You're kinda cute.. Normally I'm a gold digger, but I do make exceptions.
	lucy: You should meet me on the roof some time to smoke some cigarettes.
	- No thanks.. I really don't care for cigarettes.. Maybe we can vape instead?
		lucy: *Lucy Hated That*
		lucy: Well I certainly perfer a smokey filled mouth, but I guess I can make an exception.
		- Yes, I will meet you there!
			lucy: Great! I will meet you there!
		- I am uncomfortable but will agree to put myself in what seems to be a compromising position on the roof after work with you.
			lucy: Big bet, big bet, I will see you there ol' chump.
	- I love smoking!
		lucy: *Lucy Loved That*
		lucy: Well I will meet you there some time..
		lucy: Let say, at the end of the work day?
		- Yes, I will meet you there!
			lucy: Good! I look forward to seeing you there.
		- Things seem pretty linear here lately, I dont really see myself having a choice.
			lucy: You're so weird sometimes, even though we have never met. I can just tell. See you there!
	boss: I see you have met my wife!
	boss: She really is a special gal..
	boss: Sometimes I think about how lucky I am.. Sometimes I can be a real devil and she doesnt always like that..
	boss: But you know how it is.. Us guys.. Bein' guys..
	boss: She went for me because I smelled like burnt embers..
	boss: ...
	boss: Anyways, get to Toby, he still needs help.
	boss: May the shareholders guide your hands.
	[signal arg="complete_chat2"]
elif {chatstep} == 2.0:
	(You hear some rustling in the window)
	(You look out the window and see a blue cone sticking out of the bushes.. wierd)
	boss: Go check her computer out. May the shareholder light the way.
	- I saw a blue cone sticking out of the bushes.. it had stars on it..
		boss: Huh.. That sure is out of the ordinary.
	- okay
		boss: Okay.. Go.
	[signal arg="complete_chat3"]
elif {chatstep} == 3.0:
	lucy: Wow, I like how you handled Sarah..
	lucy: I was just trying to win a free purse and it asked me to log in.
	lucy: Any chance you can come check out my computer and help me?
	- Yes of course.. But I have to warn you I am a little bit shy and I may cry..
		lucy: *Lucy Liked That*
		lucy: Awesome! See you at my computer Big Boy!
	- No thanks "ol' chump"
		lucy: *Lucy Didn't Liked That - and went and told her husband on you...*
		boss: Hey I overheard you and my wife talking, and well.. You do work here after all..
		boss: So go check out her computer and make sure her downloads aren't viruses..
		boss: Theres an extra 20 in it if you hit her with the "Your husband is sure a nice boss".
		boss: Run along now.
		boss: And remember..
		boss: The shareholders are always watching...
	[signal arg="complete_chat4"]
elif {chatstep} == 4.0:
	lucy: Oh my goodness.. I can't believe you were able to do that..
	lucy: I've been asking my husband to do that for so long.. He's not a good person..
	lucy: Honeslty.. He's the devil.. He's just awful.. All he cares about is the shareholders..
	lucy: Can I tell you something..?
	- Yes of course, Lucy.
		lucy: I have doubts..
		lucy: About the shareholders I mean..
		lucy: Do they really have our best interests in mind?
		lucy: Sometimes I'm not so sure..
	- Lucy.. It will all be okay.. One day I will take you from this place.. One day I will hold you as if you were my own..
		lucy: *Lucy LOVED That*
		lucy: Oh how I wish the gods of time would whisk me away to around 5ish, when I will be on the roof later..
		- What the **** are you talking about?
			lucy: *Lucy Didn't Like That*
			lucy: See you on the roof later! BYE.
	- I can tell where this is going.. I'd rather not talk bad about the shareholders..
		lucy: *Lucy Didn't Like That*
		lucy: Actually I was going to say I am really looking forward to meeting you on the roof later..
		lucy: Just please don't tell.. You know who..
		- I would never!
			lucy: I knew I could count on you!
	elbow: pssst.... pssstttt... pppsssssssttttt... pppsssssttt..
	- Hello?
		elbow: Ahoy, names Elbow... On account of eye.. or..
		elbow: .. Lack thereof..
		- Umm.. Okay, what do you want?
			elbow: Well I'm something of a wizard you see.. Well I was...
			elbow: Long ago I was but a young lad.. A young handsome lad..
			elbow: Studying under the tootilage of a great and powerful warlock I learned the magic of..
			elbow: COMPUTING!
			elbow: I quickly became adept and after leaving my commune acquired a job with a company..
			elbow: This company..
			elbow: But alas!
			elbow: A freak knife-eye-booger accident, that could have happened to anyone, happened to me!
			elbow: After some time I learned a really cool party trick..
			elbow: I could put my arm into my eye hole up to my elbow... Hense the name..
			elbow: Any-what-have-its, I was wrongfully terminated from my position.. Your position..
			elbow: And I'm here to seek revenge! I have placed a USB Rubber ducky somewhere in this office!
			elbow: Good luck finding it.. Chump..
			And as quickly as he came, the wizard elbow was gone.. Never to be seen or heard from again hopefully..
	[signal arg="complete_chat5"]
elif {chatstep} == 5.0:
	CONGRATULATIONS!
	You completed your first day.
	Would you like to meet lucy on the roof?
	- No, I'm alright..
		Really? I feel like that might sit well with her.
		I mean you were all buddy buddy with her earlier, but NOW you're "alright"?
		I just think it's funny how "some people" play with the hearts of others..
		- okay, okay, I'll go, geez
	- YES!
		Careful tiger, there is an old saying about love.
		Love is like a kitten...
		Warm and cuddley...
		Until it eats your face after you fall off a ladder.
	[signal arg="complete_chat6"]
[end_timeline]